<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Course Projects on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/categories/course-projects/</link><description>Recent content in Course Projects on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 15 May 2017 11:01:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/categories/course-projects/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MATLAB Speech Denoising with a FLATTOPWIN FIR Filter and Spectrum Analysis</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/maspdeflfi.html</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 May 2017 11:01:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/maspdeflfi.html</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="abstract"&gt;Abstract&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#abstract"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course project designs a finite impulse response filter with the window method and applies it to a speech recording contaminated by a single sinusoidal tone. Time-domain waveforms and spectra before and after filtering are compared to evaluate noise suppression and speech distortion.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The original project used MATLAB 7.0; the workflow below uses current function forms while preserving the experiment.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="load-and-inspect-the-signal"&gt;Load and inspect the signal&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#load-and-inspect-the-signal"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-matlab" data-lang="matlab"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;audioread&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;wav&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c"&gt;% mono&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;numel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;toneFrequency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;7000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;noisy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;speech&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.08&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;sin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;pi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;toneFrequency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;nfft&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;^&lt;span class="nb"&gt;nextpow2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;numel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;noisy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;));&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;nfft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;nfft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;spectrum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;abs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;noisy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;nfft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;));&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;plot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;spectrum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;nfft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;));&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;xlabel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Frequency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Hz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The added tone must be below the Nyquist frequency and outside the speech band that the selected low-pass filter is intended to preserve.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MATLAB AM Modulation Simulation: Envelope, Coherent Demodulation and Noise</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/maammosien.html</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Jan 2017 06:35:37 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/maammosien.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Amplitude modulation is a useful introduction to how a baseband message changes a carrier and how a receiver recovers that message. In conventional AM with carrier,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;[&#10;s(t) = A_c,[1 + \mu m_n(t)]\cos(2\pi f_c t),&#10;]&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;where the normalized message satisfies &lt;code&gt;|m_n(t)| ≤ 1&lt;/code&gt;. Keeping &lt;code&gt;0 ≤ μ ≤ 1&lt;/code&gt; avoids overmodulation for envelope detection.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="generate-the-signal"&gt;Generate the signal&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#generate-the-signal"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-matlab" data-lang="matlab"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;100e3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;duration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;duration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fm&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fc&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;10e3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Ac&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;mu&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;0.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;message&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;cos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;pi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;carrier&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;cos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;pi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;fc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;am&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Ac&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;.*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;carrier&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The sample rate must comfortably exceed twice the highest generated frequency.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>